{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-15_end","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-15","title":"原野に注ぐ「怒火」","storyCode":"JT8-1","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-15_end.txt","sourceHash":"a5f2688e3d453ddcb5195348a44e14a4c0e5d728a55e003b03e3d7817f4c4833","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"憎しみを抑えられない程の悪が横行した時、正義を標榜する戦士は悲痛なる真実に向き合わざるを得なかった。彼女の意思は、自らが背負う影と真実によって呑み込まれてしまう。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス農民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"うわあああああああ！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス農民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"火！？　火だ！！　うわああああ熱い！　熱い！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス農民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"助けてくれ！！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"パパ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歩哨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"なんてことだ！　早く、早く消せ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"せがれが、わしのせがれが！　畜生……この感染した畜生め！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ひいぃ！　火、火が大きすぎる！　ゴホッゴホッゴホッ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"この畜生め！　死んでもお前を呪ってやる……呪ってやるぞ！！　ああ、皇帝陛下！　この忌々しい感染者どもに罰を！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あ……あぁ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"もう後戻りはできない。\nここで起きたことは、タルラ以外に知る者はいない。\nそしてこれ以降のことは、多くの者がよく知っている。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"お前が私を理解し、肯定し、自分がどのような大地に生きているかに気づいた時……\nウルサスの未来はお前の手中に収まるだろう。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_top"},{"type":"narration","text":"アーミヤは目を開いた。\n彼女の涙はまだ乾いていない。だが、すでに彼女は全てを見た。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"――！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"タルラ","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"どうしてここにコータスがいる？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ！　気をつけろ！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["チェン"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["タルラ"]}]}
